  "review": [
    "Explicit complex Sonnet requests reach the existing Workspace planner directResponse path without an inference call. A sealed 15-minute exact-payload plan prepares a separate spending review. No sentiment escalation, automatic fallback or tool/repository mutation is permitted.",
    "The actual existing confirmation claim and pre-effect RPC issue the current actor permit. Model target digest, nonce, reason, endpoint, model, token bound and conservative per-task estimate must still match at reservation and dispatch. Account budgets remain independently enforced. Fixed technical task ceiling is 50000 micro-USD, not an allowance to spend.",
    "Private result persistence uses the existing StorageService issued actor and project boundary. Consumed owner-filtered confirmation plus matching receipt/object digest is required to reopen. GET does not invoke a provider. Unknown dispatch and paid publication failure cannot replay.",
    "New Buffer.from(text) is native UTF-8 encoding only. The storage write itself remains an explicit issued-actor StorageService operation, not excluded by the static conversion disposition.",
    "Structured response_format is cloned and bound at the canonical tenant dispatch boundary. Multi-choice responses, post-finish SSE content, repeated terminal usage and wrong identity remain invalid. No second model or retry was added.",
    "Coverage preserves separately requested same-format obligations, exact user quotes and original failed output. Planner ID collisions cannot erase a required concept. Captured role-table evidence remains a failed partial excerpt, never a full SaaS acceptance."
  ],
